We did Microstation comparisons between Pentium and Alpha.

Pentium: 133MHz, 128Mb ram and 2Gb hdd.
Alpha: 275MHz, 128Mb ram and 2Gb hdd (Citum 275XS, based on Aspen's
motherboard).

Software: Microstation 5.0.95.48 with TerraSolid MDL application.

Test: 800 000 points 3D city-model.

Results: Pentium 1h 49min and Alpha 0h 48min.

So...Alpha beats Pentium with a great marginal..and test with
1500000 points - forget with Pentium, do it with Alpha...

Regards,

